          {
            "title": "Comparing",
            "id": 126347,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Abbiamo imparato a creare e memorizzare valori, ma come facciamo a confrontarli?</p><p>Dobbiamo confrontare i numeri in situazioni come verificare che il PIN inserito da un utente corrisponda al PIN salvato.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enteredPin = \" /><text value=\"5448\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" expectedPin = \" /><text value=\"5440\" class=\"number\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Equality operator",
            "id": 126348,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per confrontare se due numeri sono uguali in Swift, usiamo l'<strong>operatore di uguaglianza</strong>, <code>==</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"4\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "True or false",
            "id": 126349,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [
              {
                "id": "83e1e899-d397-4889-baff-8c31a640bb6e"
              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando confronti, ci sono solo due risultati: <code>true</code> o <code>false</code>.</p><img src=\"83e1e899-d397-4889-baff-8c31a640bb6e\" visible-if=\"always\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "True",
            "id": 126350,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando confrontiamo gli stessi numeri con l'operatore di uguaglianza, il risultato è <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>10</code>, seguito da <code>==</code> e infine <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "False",
            "id": 126351,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando confrontiamo due numeri diversi con l'operatore di uguaglianza, il risultato è <code>false</code>.</p><p>Scegli l'opzione che confronta <code>9</code> con <code>10</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 = 10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>9 == 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 126352,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa usiamo per verificare se due numeri sono uguali in Swift?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>==</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 126353,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>false</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 126354,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In quale di queste situazioni dovremmo verificare se due numeri sono uguali?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando controlli se il numero di vite rimanenti di un giocatore è <em>esattamente</em> 5</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quando controlli se il numero di vite rimanenti di un giocatore è <em>minore o uguale a</em> 3</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando controlli se il numero di vite rimanenti di un giocatore è <em>esattamente</em> 5.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 126355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"18\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>18</code> e poi <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>18</code> e poi <code>513</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>18</code> e poi <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 126356,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifica se il valore di <code>votes</code> è uguale a <code>11</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" votes = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(votes == \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>, seguito da <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
