        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Not equal",
            "id": 126360,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per verificare se un numero non è uguale a un altro numero, usiamo l'<strong>operatore di disuguaglianza</strong>, <code>!=</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"10\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Result !=",
            "id": 126361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo memorizzare il risultato di un confronto con l'operatore di disuguaglianza in una variabile.</p><p>Salva il confronto tra <code>1</code> e <code>2</code> nella variabile <code>result</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Result ==",
            "id": 126362,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le variabili possono memorizzare anche il risultato dei confronti di uguaglianza.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Compare variables",
            "id": 126363,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo confrontare i valori con le variabili e le variabili con altre variabili.</p><p>Usa <code>==</code> per confrontare i contenuti delle variabili in Swift.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" one = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" two = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(one == two)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(one != two)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"36\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 126364,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale valore dovrebbe avere <code>batteryLevel</code> affinché il confronto nella variabile <code>charged</code> dia <code>false</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" batteryLevel = ?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" charged = batteryLevel == \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>78</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>78</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 126365,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 126366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale valore dovremmo assegnare alla costante <code>emails</code> per memorizzare <code>true</code> in <code>inboxFull</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" emails = ? \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inboxFull = emails == \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1000</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>67</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 126367,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale dovrebbe essere il valore di <code>scoreOne</code> se vogliamo che <code>equal</code> sia <code>true</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreOne = ?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreTwo = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"equal\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" = scoreOne == scoreTwo\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>80</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
